        "explanation": "The change adds a Clients resource type and a resolveClient helper. The helper looks up a client by id and then by clientId within the current realm, mirroring the existing resolveUser. An unresolved id still throws IllegalStateException, so an unknown client cannot get a resource created for it. MgmtPermissionsV2.clients() only returns a lazily cached ClientPermissionsV2, and no existing check was removed or loosened. I did not open ClientPermissionsV2, so I did not verify the permission checks it performs.",
